{'symbol': 'DISH', 'date': '2021-05-11 09:00:00', 'title': 'DISH NETWORK PLACES OFFERING OF $1,500,000,000 IN SENIOR NOTES', 'text': 'ENGLEWOOD, COLO., MAY 11, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DISH NETWORK CORPORATION ("DISH NETWORK") (NASDAQ: DISH) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ON MAY 10, 2021 ITS SUBSIDIARY,\xa0DISH DBS CORPORATION ("DISH DBS"), PRICED AN OFFERING OF $1,500,000,000 AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ITS 5.125% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2029 (THE "NOTES").'}